            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ yi̱k mi ba wal ti la ŋuäny gɔaa a waŋkɛ wi̱i̱dɛ la̱t kɛ jiath thëëp. Bärɛ cua juäth tetdä kɛl, kä riewdɛ ɛ juäth tetdä kɛl, kui̱ckɛ diaal ca pe̱kdiɛn pa̱a̱r. Cu tho̱lɛ a jua̱th tetdä da̱ŋ rɛw, kä cua tuɔ̱ŋkɛ la̱t kɛ jɛn jiath ɔ kɛl ɔ kɛ puɔ̱nydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ jɛ rɔth kɛ da̱a̱p mi ti̱l ti̱l, biɛɛdɛ, kɛ bua̱a̱lkɛ diaal kɛnɛ tuɔ̱ŋkɛ, kä cuɛ wi̱cdɛ moc thɛɛr kɛ da̱a̱p. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ciik da̱ŋ rɛw la̱t kɛ da̱a̱p jɔkdɛ thaar thɛɛrä kui̱cni yi̱kä da̱ŋ rɛw tin luɔtkɛ rɔ̱, ala go̱o̱ni to̱ŋni tin ba ku la kapkɛ jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 37:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ to̱ŋ tɔ̱tɔ̱ la̱t kɛ thep, kä cuɛ kɛ rɔth kɛ da̱a̱p.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.37.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.37.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
